{"id": "63322821cce8e9b", "title": "进贤县环军山湖区域水厂水源连通工程设计", "sourceUrl": "https://www.ggzy.gov.cn/information/deal/html/a/360000/0101/20260713/00367b3d387d732545ef93aac1ea324c3204.html", "date": "2026-07-13", "source": "全国公共资源交易平台", "category": "工程建设/政府采购", "content": "进贤县环军山湖区域水厂水源连通工程设计\n招标公告\n1.\n招标条件\n本招标项目\n进贤县环军山湖区域水厂水源连通工程设计\n已由上级主管部门批准实施，招标人为\n进贤县水利局\n，项目已具备招标条件，现对本项目\n勘察设计\n面向国内进行公开招标。\n2.\n项目概况与招标范围\n2.1\n建设地点：\n进贤县池溪镇、钟陵镇、梅庄镇等\n。\n2.2\n项目概况：\n项目总投资约\n15244.22\n万元。\n项目主要建设内容\n:1.\n现有水厂及水源提升工程\n:\n对三阳水厂、三里水厂、梅庄水厂、钟陵水厂、南台水厂、李渡、文港等\n7\n座水厂及水源工程进行提升。\n2.\n区域水厂水源联通工程\n:\n新建前坊水厂\n-\n三阳水厂联通主管，新建池溪      水厂\n-\n钟陵水厂\n-\n南台水厂\n-\n梅庄水厂\n-\n三里水厂联通主管\n;\n军山湖水厂\n-\n七里水厂\n-\n前坊水厂\n-\n三阳水厂供水主管\n;\n军山湖水厂\n-\n池溪水厂\n-\n钟陵水厂\n-\n南台水厂\n-\n梅庄水厂\n-\n三里水厂供水主管。主要建设内容为\nDN200-DN400\n球墨铸铁管\n62.28km\n及配套设施等。\n3.\n进村入户及管网延伸工程\n:\n通过对梅庄水厂、钟陵水厂、南台水厂、文港水厂、李渡水厂等\n5\n座水厂管网延伸，覆盖供水区域内的小散工程，新建\nDe32-De160PE\n管网约\n209.1km\n，并安装入户水表及配套设施等。\n2.3\n招标控制价\n：\n本项目\n勘察设计费采用费率招标，招标控制费率为\n75%\n，勘察设计费按初步设计概算批复的勘察设计费×中标费率计取。\n（最终勘察设计费以决算审计的金额为准）。\n2.4\n勘察设计周期：\n自合同签订之日起\n20\n天内完成可研报告，接到业主通知后，\n30\n天内完成实施方案。招标设计及施工图设计时间节点满足业主要求。\n2.5\n招标范围：\n本项目地质勘察、地形及工程测量、可行性研究报告编制、初步设计、施工图设计等前期工作及施工期间的设计服务。\n2.6\n标段划分：划分为\n1\n个标段。\n2.7\n质量要求：\n符合现行国家相关水利行业工程地勘、测量和设计相关规范用标准，并通过相关部门的审批。\n3.\n投标人资格要求\n3.1\n本次勘察设计招标要求投标人须同时具备以下资格条件：\n（\n1\n）在中华人民共和国境内注册、具有独立法人资格\n，\n具\n有效营业执照\n。\n（\n2\n）投标人法定代表人直接参加招投标活动的，应当出具其法定代表人证明材料；投标人法定代表人不直接参加招投标活动的，应委托其他人担任投标单位的授权委托人，且受委托人须提供社保证明材料，并出具授权委托书及受委托人的居民身份证。\n（\n3\n）\n同时具备\n①\n工程设计水利行业\n乙\n级或\n市政行业（给水工程）专业设计乙级及以上资质\n②\n工程勘察（岩土工程）乙级\n、\n测绘乙级\n及以上资质\n。\n（\n4\n）\n拟派本项目的项目负责人具有水利类专业工程师\n或给排水专业工程师\n及以上职称（按《关于印发江西省非国有企业工程专业技术人员职称申报条件的通知》赣建人〔\n2022\n〕\n5\n号规定，非国有企业水利专业技术职称不予认可）。\n（\n5\n）\n投标人未处于被责令停业、取消、暂停江西省水利工程投标资格状态。开标前已在江西省公共资源数智交易平台\n--\n水利勘察设计单位基本信息\n登记状态为\n“验证通过”的视为有效，其他视为无效。\n3.2\n本次招标不接受联合体投标。\n4.\n资格审查办法\n4.1\n本次招标采用资格后审合格制（开标后评标委员会审查），具体详见招标文件评标办法内容。\n5.\n招标文件的获取\n5.1\n凡符合资格条件且有意参加投标者，请于\n202\n6\n年\n7\n月\n13\n日至\n202\n6\n年\n8\n月\n5\n日在江西省公共资源交易网\n(\nhttps://www.jxsggzy.cn/\n)\n自行下载招标文件。不清楚或有疑问需咨询的，请致电江苏国泰新点软件有限公司客服电话：\n0512-58188507\n。\n6.\n投标文件的递交\n6.1\n投标文件递交的截止时间为：\n202\n6\n年\n8\n月\n6\n日\n10\n时\n00\n分。\n6.2\n未在投标截止时间前上传电子版投标文件至电子招标系统中的投标文件，招标人不予受理。\n6.3\n本项目采用\n“\n不见面开标\n”\n系统开标，投标企业不需要到场参加开标会，现场环节\n(\n包括但不限于现场签到、递交原件、现场解锁等\n)\n全部转为不见面开标系统线上操作，投标企业应在开标截止时间前一小时进入江西省公共资源交易网\n-\n不见面开标大厅进行线上签到，未线上签到将无法进入后续的开标环节，因此引起的一切后。由投标企业自行承担。具体操作详见\n“\n江西省公共资源交易网\n-\n帮助中心\n-\n操作手册\n-\n南昌市公共资源交易中心不见面开标系统建设项目\n-\n投标人操作手册（水利）\n”\n。\n7.\n有关说明\n7.1\n现场由投标人自行勘察，由此产生的费用由投标人自行承担。有关本次招标的解答、澄清和修改等补充材料，将在江西省公共资源交易网上发布，请潜在投标人随时关注并及时下载有关补充材料。\n7.2\n本项目评标全过程由进贤县水务局工程招标投标监督办公室进行监督。\n8.\n发布公告的媒介\n本公告将在江西省公共资源交易网发布。\n9.\n联系方式\n招\n标\n人：进贤县水利局\n地\n址：进贤县民和镇雁鱼塘路\n30\n号\n联\n系\n人：\n李\n先生\n电\n话：\n13677088912\n招标代理机构：\n南昌和轩文化实业有限公司\n地\n址：江西省南昌市\n进贤县恒茂城市之光\n11-2-1801\n室\n联\n系\n人：吴女士\n电\n话：\n15979082500", "html": "<div class=\"detail_content\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 28px; text-indent: 48px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 24px;\">进贤县环军山湖区域水厂水源连通工程设计</span></strong></h3><h3 style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 28px; text-indent: 48px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 24px;\">招标公告</span></strong></h3><h3 style=\"line-height: 28px; text-indent: 32px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><strong><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'>1.</span></strong><strong><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">招标条件</span></span></strong></h3><p style=\"line-height: 28px; text-indent: 32px;\"><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">本招标项目</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\">进贤县环军山湖区域水厂水源连通工程设计</span></span><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">已由上级主管部门批准实施，招标人为</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">进贤县水利局</span></span></span><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">，项目已具备招标条件，现对本项目</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">勘察设计</span></span></span><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">面向国内进行公开招标。</span></span></p><h3 style=\"line-height: 28px; text-indent: 32px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><strong><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'>2.<span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">项目概况与招标范围</span></span></strong></h3><p style=\"line-height: 28px; text-indent: 32px;\"><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'>2.1<span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">建设地点：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\">进贤县池溪镇、钟陵镇、梅庄镇等</span><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">。</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 29px; text-indent: 32px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'>2.2<span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">项目概况： </span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">项目总投资约</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">15244.22 </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">万元。</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 29px; text-indent: 24px; margin-left: 32px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">项目主要建设内容</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">:1.</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">现有水厂及水源提升工程</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">:</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">对三阳水厂、三里水厂、梅庄水厂、钟陵水厂、南台水厂、李渡、文港等</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">7</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">座水厂及水源工程进行提升。</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 29px; text-indent: 32px; margin-left: 32px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2.</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">区域水厂水源联通工程</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">:</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">新建前坊水厂</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">三阳水厂联通主管，新建池溪      水厂</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">钟陵水厂</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">南台水厂</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">梅庄水厂</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">三里水厂联通主管</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">;</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">军山湖水厂</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">七里水厂</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">前坊水厂</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">三阳水厂供水主管</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">;</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">军山湖水厂</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">池溪水厂</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">钟陵水厂</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">南台水厂</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">梅庄水厂</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">三里水厂供水主管。主要建设内容为</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">DN200-DN400</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">球墨铸铁管</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">62.28km</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">及配套设施等。</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 29px; text-indent: 32px; margin-left: 32px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3.</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">进村入户及管网延伸工程</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">:</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">通过对梅庄水厂、钟陵水厂、南台水厂、文港水厂、李渡水厂等</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">座水厂管网延伸，覆盖供水区域内的小散工程，新建 </span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">De32-De160PE</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">管网约</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">209.1km</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">，并安装入户水表及配套设施等。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 19px 0px 0px; line-height: 150%; text-indent: 28px;\"><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'>2.3<span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">招标控制价</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\">本项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">勘察设计费采用费率招标，招标控制费率为</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">75%</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">，勘察设计费按初步设计概算批复的勘察设计费×中标费率计取。</span></span><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">（最终勘察设计费以决算审计的金额为准）。</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 150%; text-indent: 32px; margin-top: 14px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style='line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'>2.4<span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">勘察设计周期：</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">自合同签订之日起</span> <span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">20 </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">天内完成可研报告，接到业主通知后，</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">30</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">天内完成实施方案。招标设计及施工图设计时间节点满足业主要求。</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 28px; text-indent: 32px;\"><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'>2.5<span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">招标范围：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\">本项目地质勘察、地形及工程测量、可行性研究报告编制、初步设计、施工图设计等前期工作及施工期间的设计服务。</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 28px; text-indent: 32px;\"><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'>2.6<span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">标段划分：划分为</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">个标段。</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 28px; text-indent: 32px;\"><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'>2.7<span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">质量要求：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\">符合现行国家相关水利行业工程地勘、测量和设计相关规范用标准，并通过相关部门的审批。</span></p><h3 style=\"line-height: 28px; text-indent: 32px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><strong><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'>3.<span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">投标人资格要求</span></span></strong></h3><p style=\"line-height: 28px; text-indent: 32px;\"><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'>3.1 <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">本次勘察设计招标要求投标人须同时具备以下资格条件：</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 28px; text-indent: 32px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">）在中华人民共和国境内注册、具有独立法人资格</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\">具</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\">有效营业执照</span><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 28px; text-indent: 32px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">）投标人法定代表人直接参加招投标活动的，应当出具其法定代表人证明材料；投标人法定代表人不直接参加招投标活动的，应委托其他人担任投标单位的授权委托人，且受委托人须提供社保证明材料，并出具授权委托书及受委托人的居民身份证。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 28px; text-indent: 32px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">（</span>3<span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\">同时具备</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\">①</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\">工程设计水利行业</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\">乙</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\">级或</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">市政行业（给水工程）专业设计乙级及以上资质</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">②</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\">工程勘察（岩土工程）乙级</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\">测绘乙级</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\">及以上资质</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\">。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 28px; text-indent: 32px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">（</span>4<span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\">拟派本项目的项目负责人具有水利类专业工程师</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\">或给排水专业工程师</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">及以上职称（按《关于印发江西省非国有企业工程专业技术人员职称申报条件的通知》赣建人〔</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2022</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">〕</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">号规定，非国有企业水利专业技术职称不予认可）。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 28px; text-indent: 32px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">（</span>5<span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\">投标人未处于被责令停业、取消、暂停江西省水利工程投标资格状态。开标前已在江西省公共资源数智交易平台</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">--</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">水利勘察设计单位基本信息</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">登记状态为</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">“验证通过”的视为有效，其他视为无效。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 28px; text-indent: 32px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'>3.2 <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">本次招标不接受联合体投标。</span></span></p><h3 style=\"line-height: 28px; text-indent: 32px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><strong><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'>4.<span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">资格审查办法 </span></span></strong></h3><p style=\"line-height: 28px; text-indent: 32px;\"><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'>4.1<span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">本次招标采用资格后审合格制（开标后评标委员会审查），具体详见招标文件评标办法内容。</span></span></p><h3 style=\"line-height: 28px; text-indent: 32px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><strong><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'>5.<span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">招标文件的获取</span></span></strong></h3><p style=\"line-height: 28px; text-indent: 32px;\"><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'>5.1<span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">凡符合资格条件且有意参加投标者，请于</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">202</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span></span><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">7</span></span><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">月</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">13</span></span><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">日至</span>202</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span></span><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8</span></span><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">月</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5</span></span><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">日在江西省公共资源交易网</span>(</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.jxsggzy.cn/</span></span><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'>)<span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">自行下载招标文件。不清楚或有疑问需咨询的，请致电江苏国泰新点软件有限公司客服电话：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0512-58188507</span></span><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">。</span></span></p><h3 style=\"line-height: 28px; text-indent: 32px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><strong><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'>6.<span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">投标文件的递交</span></span></strong></h3><p style=\"line-height: 28px; text-indent: 32px;\"><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'>6.1<span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">投标文件递交的截止时间为：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">202</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span></span><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8</span></span><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">月</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span></span><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">日</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">10</span></span><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">时</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">00</span></span><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">分。</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 28px; text-indent: 32px;\"><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'>6.2 <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">未在投标截止时间前上传电子版投标文件至电子招标系统中的投标文件，招标人不予受理。</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 28px; text-indent: 32px;\"><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'>6.3 <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">本项目采用</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">“</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">不见面开标</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">”</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">系统开标，投标企业不需要到场参加开标会，现场环节</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">包括但不限于现场签到、递交原件、现场解锁等</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">全部转为不见面开标系统线上操作，投标企业应在开标截止时间前一小时进入江西省公共资源交易网</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">不见面开标大厅进行线上签到，未线上签到将无法进入后续的开标环节，因此引起的一切后。由投标企业自行承担。具体操作详见</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">“</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">江西省公共资源交易网</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">帮助中心</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">操作手册</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">南昌市公共资源交易中心不见面开标系统建设项目</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">投标人操作手册（水利）</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">”</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">。</span></span></p><h3 style=\"line-height: 28px; text-indent: 32px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><strong><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'>7.<span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">有关说明</span></span></strong></h3><p style=\"line-height: 28px; text-indent: 32px;\"><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'>7.1<span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">现场由投标人自行勘察，由此产生的费用由投标人自行承担。有关本次招标的解答、澄清和修改等补充材料，将在江西省公共资源交易网上发布，请潜在投标人随时关注并及时下载有关补充材料。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-indent: 32px;\"><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'>7.2<span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">本项目评标全过程由进贤县水务局工程招标投标监督办公室进行监督。</span></span></p><h3 style=\"line-height: 28px; text-indent: 32px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><strong><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'>8.</span></strong><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'> </span><strong><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">发布公告的媒介</span></span></strong></h3><p style=\"line-height: 28px; text-indent: 32px;\"><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">本公告将在江西省公共资源交易网发布。</span></span></p><h3 style=\"line-height: 28px; text-indent: 32px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><strong><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'>9.<span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">联系方式</span></span></strong></h3><p style=\"line-height: 28px; text-indent: 32px;\"><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">招</span> <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">标</span> <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">人：进贤县水利局</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 28px; text-indent: 32px;\"><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">地</span>    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">址：进贤县民和镇雁鱼塘路</span>30<span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">号 </span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 28px; text-indent: 32px;\"><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">联</span> <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">系</span> <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">人：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\">李</span><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">先生</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 28px; text-indent: 32px;\"><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">电</span>    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">话：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">13677088912</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 28px; text-indent: 32px;\"><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">招标代理机构：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\">南昌和轩文化实业有限公司</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 28px; text-indent: 32px;\"><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">地</span> <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">址：江西省南昌市</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">进贤县恒茂城市之光</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">11-2-1801</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">室</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 28px; text-indent: 32px;\"><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">联</span> <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">系</span> <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">人：吴女士</span> </span></p><p style=\"line-height: 28px; text-indent: 32px;\"><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">电</span>    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">话：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">15979082500</span></span></p><p><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 16px;'> </span></p><p><br/></p>\n</div>", "method": "工程建设/政府采购", "region": "全国", "buyer": "", "deadline": "", "budget": "", "attachments": [], "hasAttachment": false, "is_bidding": true}